# The second movement of the opening: Lino comes up the street and finds the
# notice. The first movement is the order of withdrawal, which is a Control and
# not a sequence — see scripts/ui/intro_screen.gd.
#
# The last step is what makes this play once: game.gd checks intro_seen before
# starting it.

uid baggaseqintr01

walk  AtDoor
say   SEQ_INTRO_ARRIVE

# The van is behind him as he arrives, so he turns to it and the thud lands
# while he is looking that way.
face  AtVan
sound thud
say   SEQ_INTRO_VAN

face  AtDoor
say   SEQ_INTRO_NOTICE
flag  intro_seen
